Adds a small browser-level suite around the real unpacked MV3 extension.

### Coverage
- explicit selection capture on an ordinary page;
- side-panel refresh after background capture without reloading the panel;
- empty-selection failure with no write;
- the same context-menu capture handler used by the registered browser menu;
- useful failure on a restricted `chrome://` page;
